{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMultiPolygon(cm)multiPolygonWithPolygons:","roleHeading":"Type Method","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:"}],"role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates and returns a multipolygon object consisting of the given polygons."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolygon\/multipolygonwithpolygons:"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon\/multiPolygonWithPolygons:"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"instancetype"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray<MLNPolygon *>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"polygons"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"polygons","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The array of polygons defining the shape."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A new multipolygon object."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPolygon":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object represents a shape consisting of one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"polygons that do not overlap. For example, you could use a multipolygon shape"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to represent the body of land that consists of an island surrounded by an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"atoll: the inner island would be one "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object, while the surrounding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"atoll would be another. You could also use a multipolygon shape to represent a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"group of disconnected but related buildings."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolygon","role":"symbol","title":"MLNMultiPolygon","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMultiPolygon"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPolygon":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNPolygon"}],"type":"topic","title":"MLNPolygon","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpolygon","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object represents a closed shape consisting of four or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices, specified as "},{"code":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instances, and the edges that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connect them. For example, you could use a polygon shape to represent a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"building, a lake, or an area you want to highlight."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPolygon/multiPolygonWithPolygons:":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates and returns a multipolygon object consisting of the given polygons."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolygon\/multipolygonwithpolygons:","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon\/multiPolygonWithPolygons:","title":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","title":"MapLibre","role":"collection"}}}